  "title": "Red Hat Security Advisory: Red Hat JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 8.1.9 XP 6.0.7.GA release",
  "description": "Red Hat has released a cumulative patch update for JBoss Enterprise Application Platform 8.1.9 XP 6.0.7.GA addressing multiple security vulnerabilities across various components including Netty, Apache ZooKeeper, RESTEasy, zstd-jni, jackson-databind, Micrometer, and Apache Qpid Proton-J. The fixes address issues such as information disclosure, denial of service, remote unauthenticated file read, use-after-free, improper certificate validation, and log injection. This update consolidates numerous security fixes to improve the security posture of the JBoss EAP runtime distribution.",
